      "rendered": "<p><strong>This is our family through the years. </strong></p>\n<div data-shortcode=\"caption\" id=\"attachment_39\" style=\"width: 594px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><a href=\"http://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/10/pearson-1-edit_edited-11.jpg\"><img aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-39\" data-attachment-id=\"39\" data-permalink=\"https://kidinjurylaw.com/about/pearson-1-edit_edited-1/\" data-orig-file=\"https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/10/pearson-1-edit_edited-11.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"800,532\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;3.5&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;NIKON D700&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;1317216478&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;50&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;200&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0.0025&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"pearson 1 edit_edited-1\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"&lt;p&gt;Pearson Family, October 2011&lt;/p&gt;\n\" data-large-file=\"https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/10/pearson-1-edit_edited-11.jpg?w=800\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-full wp-image-39\" title=\"pearson 1 edit_edited-1\" src=\"https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/10/pearson-1-edit_edited-11.jpg?w=584&#038;h=388\" alt=\"\" width=\"584\" height=\"388\" srcset=\"https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/10/pearson-1-edit_edited-11.jpg?w=584&amp;h=388 584w, https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/10/pearson-1-edit_edited-11.jpg?w=150&amp;h=100 150w, https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/10/pearson-1-edit_edited-11.jpg?w=300&amp;h=200 300w, https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/10/pearson-1-edit_edited-11.jpg?w=768&amp;h=511 768w, https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/10/pearson-1-edit_edited-11.jpg 800w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 584px) 100vw, 584px\" /></a><p id=\"caption-attachment-39\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Pearson Family &#8211; 2011</p></div>\n<div data-shortcode=\"caption\" id=\"attachment_1053\" style=\"width: 1034px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"http://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/10/pearson-family-2013.jpg\"><img aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-1053\" data-attachment-id=\"1053\" data-permalink=\"https://kidinjurylaw.com/about/pearson-family-2013/\" data-orig-file=\"https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/10/pearson-family-2013.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"960,640\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Pearson Family &amp;#8211; 2013\" data-image-description=\"&lt;p&gt;Pearson Family &amp;#8211; 2013&lt;/p&gt;\n\" data-image-caption=\"&lt;p&gt;Pearson Family &amp;#8211; 2013&lt;/p&gt;\n\" data-large-file=\"https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/10/pearson-family-2013.jpg?w=960\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-large wp-image-1053\" src=\"https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/10/pearson-family-2013.jpg?w=1024&#038;h=682\" alt=\"Pearson Family - 2013\"   srcset=\"https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/10/pearson-family-2013.jpg?w=584 584w, https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/10/pearson-family-2013.jpg?w=150 150w, https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/10/pearson-family-2013.jpg?w=300 300w, https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/10/pearson-family-2013.jpg?w=768 768w, https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/10/pearson-family-2013.jpg 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 584px) 100vw, 584px\" /></a><p id=\"caption-attachment-1053\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Pearson Family &#8211; 2013</p></div>\n<p><a href=\"https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/10/2015-christmas-photo-card.png\"><img data-attachment-id=\"1096\" data-permalink=\"https://kidinjurylaw.com/about/2015-christmas-photo-card/\" data-orig-file=\"https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/10/2015-christmas-photo-card.png\" data-orig-size=\"656,921\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"2015 Christmas Photo Card\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/10/2015-christmas-photo-card.png?w=656\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-1096\" src=\"https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/10/2015-christmas-photo-card.png?w=729&#038;h=1024\" alt=\"2015 Christmas Photo Card\"   srcset=\"https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/10/2015-christmas-photo-card.png?w=584 584w, https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/10/2015-christmas-photo-card.png?w=107 107w, https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/10/2015-christmas-photo-card.png?w=214 214w, https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/10/2015-christmas-photo-card.png 656w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 584px) 100vw, 584px\" /></a></p>\n<p>~ Pearson Family &#8211; 2015<a href=\"https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/family-pic-2017.jpg\"><img data-attachment-id=\"1098\" data-permalink=\"https://kidinjurylaw.com/about/family-pic-2017/\" data-orig-file=\"https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/family-pic-2017.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1440,1080\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Family Pic 2017\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/family-pic-2017.jpg?w=1024\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-1098\" src=\"https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/family-pic-2017.jpg?w=1024&#038;h=768\" alt=\"\"   srcset=\"https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/family-pic-2017.jpg?w=584 584w, https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/family-pic-2017.jpg?w=1168 1168w, https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/family-pic-2017.jpg?w=150 150w, https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/family-pic-2017.jpg?w=300 300w, https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/family-pic-2017.jpg?w=768 768w, https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/family-pic-2017.jpg?w=1024 1024w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 584px) 100vw, 584px\" /></a></p>\n<p>~Pearson Family &#8211; 2017</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/67703255_10220346674162898_2209801265527914496_o.jpg\"><img data-attachment-id=\"1107\" data-permalink=\"https://kidinjurylaw.com/about/67703255_10220346674162898_2209801265527914496_o/\" data-orig-file=\"https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/67703255_10220346674162898_2209801265527914496_o.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1480,720\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"67703255_10220346674162898_2209801265527914496_o\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/67703255_10220346674162898_2209801265527914496_o.jpg?w=1024\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-1107\" src=\"https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/67703255_10220346674162898_2209801265527914496_o.jpg?w=1024&#038;h=498\" alt=\"\"   srcset=\"https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/67703255_10220346674162898_2209801265527914496_o.jpg?w=584 584w, https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/67703255_10220346674162898_2209801265527914496_o.jpg?w=1168 1168w, https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/67703255_10220346674162898_2209801265527914496_o.jpg?w=150 150w, https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/67703255_10220346674162898_2209801265527914496_o.jpg?w=300 300w, https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/67