607\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;5.6&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;hartmanphotos.com&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;Canon EOS 5D Mark IV&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;1619464219&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;45&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;1250&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0.005&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"2E0A8320 copy\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/2e0a8320-copy.jpg?w=1024\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-1229\" src=\"https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/2e0a8320-copy.jpg?w=1024&#038;h=731\" alt=\"\"   srcset=\"https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/2e0a8320-copy.jpg?w=584 584w, https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/2e0a8320-copy.jpg?w=1168 1168w, https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/2e0a8320-copy.jpg?w=150 150w, https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/2e0a8320-copy.jpg?w=300 300w, https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/2e0a8320-copy.jpg?w=768 768w, https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/2e0a8320-copy.jpg?w=1024 1024w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 584px) 100vw, 584px\" /></a></p>\n<p>~Pearson Family &#8211; 2021</p>\n<p><img data-attachment-id=\"1241\" data-permalink=\"https://kidinjurylaw.com/about/pearson-family-photo-2023/\" data-orig-file=\"https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/pearson-family-photo-2023.jpeg\" data-orig-size=\"6000,4000\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;8&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;Canon EOS Rebel SL2&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;1684504871&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;50&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;400&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0.016666666666667&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"PEARSON FAMILY PHOTO &amp;#8211; 2023\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/pearson-family-photo-2023.jpeg?w=1024\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1241\" src=\"https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/pearson-family-photo-2023.jpeg?w=6000&#038;h=4000\" alt=\"PEARSON FAMILY PHOTO - 2023\" width=\"6000\" height=\"4000\" srcset=\"https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/pearson-family-photo-2023.jpeg 6000w, https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/pearson-family-photo-2023.jpeg?w=150&amp;h=100 150w, https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/pearson-family-photo-2023.jpeg?w=300&amp;h=200 300w, https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/pearson-family-photo-2023.jpeg?w=768&amp;h=512 768w, https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/pearson-family-photo-2023.jpeg?w=1024&amp;h=683 1024w, https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/pearson-family-photo-2023.jpeg?w=1440&amp;h=960 1440w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 6000px) 100vw, 6000px\" /></p>\n<p>-Pearson Family  &#8211; 2023</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/family-picture-pearsons-june-2024.jpeg\"><img data-attachment-id=\"1246\" data-permalink=\"https://kidinjurylaw.com/about/family-picture-pearsons-june-2024/\" data-orig-file=\"https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/family-picture-pearsons-june-2024.jpeg\" data-orig-size=\"6000,4000\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;8&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;ILCE-6400&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;1719616634&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;16&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;640&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0.004&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"FAMILY PICTURE PEARSONS JUNE 2024\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/family-picture-pearsons-june-2024.jpeg?w=1024\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-1246\" src=\"https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/family-picture-pearsons-june-2024.jpeg?w=584\" alt=\"\" width=\"584\" height=\"389\" srcset=\"https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/family-picture-pearsons-june-2024.jpeg?w=584 584w, https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/family-picture-pearsons-june-2024.jpeg?w=1168 1168w, https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/family-picture-pearsons-june-2024.jpeg?w=150 150w, https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/family-picture-pearsons-june-2024.jpeg?w=300 300w, https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/family-picture-pearsons-june-2024.jpeg?w=768 768w, https://kidinjurylaw.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/family-picture-pearsons-june-2024.jpeg?w=1024 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 584px) 100vw, 584px\" /></a></p>\n<p>-Pearson Family  &#8211; 2025</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;line-height: 1.625\">I love family. My wife and I love children, as you can see! Being with children is what we love to do together, and as you can see we will be doing it for many years to come.</span></p>\n<p>Admit it. You are wondering: <em>Will they have an eleventh!? </em>Well, you&#8217;ll have to check back later and find out. Stay tuned . . .</p>\n<p>I am an advocate of living a seamless life. Who I am at home with my family is the same person that comes to work and represents your family. I don&#8217;t have one &#8220;life&#8221; at home and another &#8220;life&#8221; when I go to work. I want my life to be integrated, harmonious, whole. I want my clients to get the same love and care I have for my family. That is my goal.</p>\n<p>I am an attorney by trade. I LOVE IT. I pray I will never lose the ability to do it. The best part to me? (It sounds so naively simplistic but here it is) Helping people! I know, tried and true, old hat, predictable. Listen &#8211; some things don&#8217;t need to be improved upon. I don&#8217;t want to do something novel or exciting &#8211; I really want just to help. That&#8217;s enough, that&#8217;s success.</p>\n<p>So I would be honored if you would consider me as your family attorney. I know you have a lot of options &#8211; there are so many attorneys. It&#8217;s a privilege just to be considered by you. Thank you for checking out my site.</p>\n<p>Perservero,</p>\n<p>Pete Pearson</p>\n<p>P.S. If you need to talk, <strong>my direct line is Six-Seven-Eight 358-2564</strong>. You can find more information about me <a title=\"ABOUT ATTORNEY PETE PEARSON\" href=\"https://petepearsonlaw.com/about\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here</a> or <a href=\"http://www.avvo.com/attorneys/31145-ga-peter-pearson-531461.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>Pete Pearson</strong><b> </b>/ <strong>Attorney &amp; Counselor at Law</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Mailing Address:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>P.O. Box 394</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Newborn, Georgia 30056</strong></p>\n<p><strong>My Direct Line: Six-Seven-Eight 358-2564</strong></p>\n<p>&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8211;<span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;line-height: 1.625\">&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;-</span></p>\n<p><em>Attorney Pete Pearson is a native of the State of Maine. Northern by birth, Southern by choice, he earned his law degree from <strong>Emory University School of Law in Atlanta, Georgia</strong>, graduating near the top of his class. He earned his undergraduate degree from <strong>Gordon College in Wenham, Massachusetts</strong>, graduating Summa Cum Laude (second in his class.) He also studied at <strong>Oxford University in England</strong> for one year. Pete’s law practice has focused on personal injury since 1996. Pete’s experience makes him especially well suited to represent individuals who have been injured due to negligence. He has a special interest in representing the families of injured children and provides useful information and legal help for parents of injured children via his blog &#8211; <a title=\"Kid Injury Law\" href=\"http://kidinjurylaw.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">kidinjurylaw.com</a>.</em></p>\n<p><em>If you need assistance with a Personal Injury or Wrongful Death claim, please contact Attorney Pete Pearson at Six-Seven-Eight 358-2564 or contact him via email at </em><em><strong>pete@petepearsonlaw.com</strong></em> <em>for a free, no obligation, initial consultation.</em></p>\n<p><strong><em>Education</em></strong><br />\n<em>Juris Doctor, Emory University School of Law, 1996</em><br />\n<em>Bachelor of Arts, Gordon College, Wenham, Massachusetts, 1991</em></p>\n<p><strong><em>Jurisdictions Admitted to Practice</em></strong><br />\n<em>State of Georgia, since 1996</em></p>\n<p><strong><em>Professional &amp; Bar Association Memberships</em></strong><br />\n<em>State Bar of Georgia </em><br />\n<em>Member Since 1996</em></p>\n",
